# SHA-256 of the release archives tools/lune/bootstrap.sh may download (one line per archive, sha256sum format).
# Neither lune-org/lune nor rojo-rbx/rojo publishes checksums with its releases, so these were computed from the
# archives downloaded from the GitHub release pages on 2026-09-23 and are pinned here: a changed archive at the
# same URL fails the install instead of running.
# To bump a tool: change rokit.toml, download the new archives, replace their lines here.
